Pella Conquo Reyes is an old elven man of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]], a xenobiologist aboard a ship from beyond the [[Phenomena/Firmament|firmament]]. He is the worst worn of the ship's three survivors: wrinkled and liver-spotted, with long pointed ears. He wears the service's working garb, between a lab coat and scrubs, marked with the sixteen-pointed star.

He knew no tongue spoken on [[Færrin]], and cast his own spell of translation, a feather and a copper coin waved with a few words, so that he and the Party could understand each other. Curiosity drives him. Freed after three days without food or water, he went straight to the desks to rifle them for something to eat, and he was quick to ask whether he might study the Party's bodies. He is a noncombatant and knows it.
